   "cite": "fields-from-intensity",
   "prompt": "假设学生物理实验室中常用的氦氖激光器的输出功率为 0.250 mW。（a）如果把这样的激光束投射到直径为 1.00 mm 的圆形光斑上，它的强度是多少？（b）求磁感应强度峰值。（c）求电场强度峰值。",
   "answer": {
    "type": "multi",
    "generated_by": "source",
    "parts": [
     {
      "part": "(a) the intensity",
      "value": 318,
      "unit": "W/m²",
      "hint": "光斑是一个直径 1.00 mm 的圆，所以它的面积为 $\\pi r^2$，其中 $r = 0.500$ mm。"
     },
     {
      "part": "(b) the peak magnetic field strength",
      "value": 1.63e-06,
      "unit": "T",
      "hint": "把 $\\kIave = \\kc\\kBmago^2/2\\mu_0$ 改写成 $\\kBmago$ 的表达式。"
     },
     {
      "part": "(c) the peak electric field strength",
      "value": 490,
      "unit": "V/m",
      "hint": "电场振幅等于磁场振幅乘以光速。"
     }
    ],
    "solution": "（a） $I = \\frac{\\kP}{A} = \\frac{\\kP}{\\pi r^2} = \\frac{0.250\\times 10^{-3}\\;\\text{W}}{\\pi (0.500\\times 10^{-3}\\;\\text{m})^2} = 318\\;\\text{W/m}^2$\n\n（b） $\\kIave = \\frac{\\kc\\kBmago^2}{2\\mu_0} \\Rightarrow \\kBmago = \\left(\\frac{2\\mu_0 I}{\\kc}\\right)^{1/2} = \\left(\\frac{2(4\\pi\\times 10^{-7}\\;\\text{T}\\cdot\\text{m/A})(318.3\\;\\text{W/m}^2)}{3.00\\times 10^{8}\\;\\text{m/s}}\\right)^{1/2} = 1.63\\times 10^{-6}\\;\\text{T}$\n\n（c） $\\kEfo = \\kc\\kBmago = (3.00\\times 10^{8}\\;\\text{m/s})(1.633\\times 10^{-6}\\;\\text{T}) = 4.90\\times 10^{2}\\;\\text{V/m}$"
   }
  },
