   "cite": "fields-from-intensity",
   "prompt": "<strong>综合概念</strong> 来自一台 5.00 mW 激光器的电磁辐射集中在 $1.00\\;\\text{mm}^2$ 的面积上。（a）以 $\\text{W/m}^2$ 计的强度是多少？（b）假设一个 2.00 nC 的静电荷处在光束中。它受到的最大电场力是多少？（c）如果这个静电荷以 400 m/s 的速率运动，它能感受到的最大磁力是多少？",
   "answer": {
    "type": "multi",
    "generated_by": "source",
    "parts": [
     {
      "part": "(a) the intensity",
      "value": 5000,
      "unit": "W/m²",
      "hint": "1 平方毫米是 $1.00\\times 10^{-6}\\;\\text{m}^2$。"
     },
     {
      "part": "(b) the maximum electric force",
      "value": 3.88e-06,
      "unit": "N",
      "hint": "由强度求出电场峰值，再用 $F = qE_0$，其中取场的峰值。"
     },
     {
      "part": "(c) the maximum magnetic force",
      "value": 5.18e-12,
      "unit": "N",
      "hint": "由电场峰值求出磁场峰值，再用 $F = qvB_0$，其中取场的峰值。"
     }
    ],
    "solution": "（a）$5.00\\times 10^{3}\\;\\text{W/m}^2$\n\n（b）$3.88\\times 10^{-6}\\;\\text{N}$\n\n（c）$5.18\\times 10^{-12}\\;\\text{N}$"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "p9",
   "source_id": "fs-id1169737739948",
